          ms: ['C1 $\\dfrac{1}{25} + \\dfrac{1}{v} = \\dfrac{1}{15}$', 'A1 $v$ = 37.5 cm', 'B1 $m = v/u$ = 1.5', 'B1 real, inverted and magnified'],
