          ms: ['C1 $\\lambda = 340/600 = 0.567$ m', 'C1 path difference ÷ λ = 0.85/0.567 = 1.5', 'B1 odd number of half wavelengths ⇒ waves arrive in antiphase', 'B1 destructive interference: quiet'],
